#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install the development version of the Qiskit Runtime client."
msgstr "เรียนรู้วิธีติดตั้งเวอร์ชัน development ของ Qiskit Runtime client"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source"
msgstr "ติดตั้ง Qiskit Runtime client จาก source"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore rustup */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client from source {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-"
"client-from-source}"
msgstr ""
"ติดตั้ง Qiskit Runtime client จาก source {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-"
"client-from-source}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you install Qiskit Runtime from source, you can access the current "
"development version, instead of using the version in the Python Package "
"Index (PyPI) repository. You can therefore inspect and extend the latest "
"version of the code more efficiently.\n"
msgstr ""
"เมื่อติดตั้ง Qiskit Runtime จาก source คุณสามารถเข้าถึงเวอร์ชัน development "
"ปัจจุบันแทนที่จะใช้เวอร์ชันใน Python Package Index (PyPI) repository ดังนั้น"
" คุณสามารถตรวจสอบและขยายโค้ดเวอร์ชันล่าสุดได้อย่างมีประสิทธิภาพมากขึ้น\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create and activate a new virtual environment {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"
msgstr ""
"สร้างและเปิดใช้งาน virtual environment ใหม่ {#create-and-activate-a-new-"
"virtual-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate to your project directory and create a minimal environment with "
"only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"ไปยัง directory โครงการของคุณและสร้างสภาพแวดล้อมขั้นต่ำที่มีเฉพาะ Python "
"ติดตั้งอยู่\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"          <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```shell\n"
"            python3 -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "          <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"            ```text\n"
"            python -m venv .venv\n"
"            ```\n"
"          </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "เปิดใช้งาน environment ใหม่ของคุณ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"
msgstr ""
"         <OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
"           <TabItem value=\"mac\" label=\"macOS\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```shell\n"
"             source .venv/bin/activate\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"linux\" label=\"Linux\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"
msgstr "           <TabItem value=\"win\" label=\"Windows\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"             ```text\n"
"             .venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1\n"
"             ```\n"
"           </TabItem>\n"
"         </OperatingSystemTabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"
msgstr "ติดตั้ง Qiskit Runtime {#install-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "ทำตามขั้นตอนเหล่านี้เพื่อติดตั้ง Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the Qiskit Runtime repository.\n"
msgstr "Clone Qiskit Runtime repository\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Change to the `qiskit-ibm-runtime` directory.\n"
msgstr "เปลี่ยนไปยัง directory `qiskit-ibm-runtime`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install `qiskit-runtime`. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"ติดตั้ง `qiskit-runtime` แนะนำให้ใช้ [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) "
"เพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงการรบกวน Python installation ทั่วโลกของคุณ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Standard install**:\n"
msgstr "**การติดตั้งแบบมาตรฐาน**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Editable mode**: In this mode, you don't need to reinstall Qiskit when "
"there are code changes to the project.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Editable mode**: ในโหมดนี้ คุณไม่ต้องติดตั้ง Qiskit "
"ใหม่เมื่อมีการเปลี่ยนแปลงโค้ดในโครงการ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    pip install -e .\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    In editable mode, the compiled extensions are built in _debug mode_ "
"without optimizations.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ในโหมด editable, compiled extensions จะถูก build ใน _debug mode_ "
"โดยไม่มีการ optimize\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(Optional) If you want to run tests or linting checks, install the developer"
" requirements. We recommend using a [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) to avoid polluting"
" your global Python installation.\n"
msgstr ""
"(ทางเลือก) หากต้องการรัน tests หรือ linting checks ให้ติดตั้ง developer "
"requirements แนะนำให้ใช้ [virtual "
"environment](https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html) "
"เพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงการรบกวน Python installation ทั่วโลกของคุณ\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "ขั้นตอนถัดไป {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Read the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) to contribute to `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"คำแนะนำ\">\n"
"  - อ่าน [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) เพื่อมีส่วนร่วมกับ `qiskit-ibm-runtime`\n"
"  - [ติดตั้ง Qiskit SDK จาก source](/guides/install-qiskit-source)\n"
"  - [รันโปรแกรมแรกของคุณ](/guides/hello-world)\n"
"  - ลองทำ tutorial เช่น [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
